        // = 1e22/(5000+((10000000+432000000)/86400))
        // = 1e22/(5000+442000000/86400) = 1e22/(5000+5115.74) ≈ 1e22/10115.74 ≈ 9.88e17 ≈ 0.000988 eth
        // So drugValue ≈ 0.000988 eth for reference, 0.001976 for mutant
